--getwelds()																$*


----------put data into isoline
--putIntoIsoLine()  														$*
--dealaccordingboltdata(!isoline is isoline,!object is any)					$*mark sure the bolt format is like this F8/G9/B10

--------------get json data
--weldJson() is array   													$*
